WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.433
Every morning, your front desk logs into portal after portal,

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.200
and there's never time to read past the first screen.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.533
