5
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.967
And it goes deeper than anyone has time to.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.400
Before Darren sits down for his exam, you'll know his crown on #14 won't be covered.

7
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.033
