11
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.067
Every number comes straight from the carrier.

12
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.700
No guesses. No made-up numbers.

13
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.267
It runs on your office computer, and patient data stays with your practice.

14
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.700
InstantVerify AI.

15
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.333
The verification tool that actually understands your schedule.


